EastSun 1003: "你搜尋關鍵字的視窗 可以額外的視窗嗎 不要用內建的 並且我可以看到我之前搜尋了什麼"
- Ctrl+F / Ctrl+Shift+F open a webview window (media/findwin.js / .css), floated
  into its own window (workbench.action.moveEditorToNewWindow; setting
  find.newWindow off = a tab beside): keyword, scope, Aa / whole word / regex,
  the searches made before (globalState htd.findHistory, newest first, max 50,
  one per keyword + scope; a click searches again, x deletes, clear all), the
  results by file with the hit marked; a click opens the line in the editor
  group the user came from. Ctrl+F again = the same window, the word at the
  cursor. Setting find.window off = the old QuickPick box.
- run(..., { quiet }) from the window: no side bar pulled up, no message box.
- vscode_it: the BtnPanelLane3 selection wait 10 s -> 30 s (ran out while
  another session compiled; the detail now says data=false).
- Stray CRLF lines from tools 0149 in extension.js / smoke_extension.js back to LF.

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (lib 182, extension 225, panels incl. the find window
in Edge); real VS Code 156/159 (the 3 known stale checks).

